/*
  ShareDriveDialog.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0028 · ShareDriveDialog (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  ShareDriveDialog resolves (table "ShareDriveDialog") lives here with its web
